# Navigate to a pose. Deliberately not nav2_msgs/action/NavigateToPose: keeping our own removes a
# dependency and lets outcome map 1:1 onto eltanin's NavigateOutcome.
#
# The type is unrelated to the identically named nav2_msgs action, so the RViz Nav2 panel cannot
# drive this server.

# Goal
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped pose
---
# Result
# outcome uses the OUTCOME_* constants of eltanin_msgs/NavigationState.
uint8 outcome
string message
float64 final_position_error
---
# Feedback
NavigationState state
